0..73 Comment "// Theory inclusion (#738): `include` extends a presentation by another\'s"
74..145 Comment "// members, the included ones first, and keeps the inclusion beside the"
146..214 Comment "// value. A monoid is a semigroup with a unit; two extensions of the"
215..290 Comment "// semigroup included together meet along it, so the result has one carrier"
291..364 Comment "// and one multiplication (the pushout over what they share). The union\'s"
365..438 Comment "// rules are completed as the block\'s own: the included associativity and"
439..461 Comment "// the unit laws join."
463..526 Comment "/// A semigroup: one carrier and an associative multiplication."
